# Allowlist: the build context holds backend/ and demo/ only. Everything else at the repo
# root stays out, including SPEC.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .claude/, .agents/, .mcp.json,
# .git, .venv, frontend/ and runs/. The runtime Droid must never be able to read the agent
# docs or skills, and secrets reach the container only through env_file at run time.
*
!backend
!demo

# Excluded again inside the allowlisted trees.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/SPEC.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/.claude
**/.agents
**/.factory
**/.mcp.json
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
backend/Dockerfile
